@* نافذة منبثقة عامة للنماذج - فيها ترويسة وجسم وتذييل، وبتسكّر بالـ Escape أو بالنقر برا *@

@if (render)
{
    <div class="dialog-layer @(closing ? "is-closing" : "")" @ref="layerRef" tabindex="-1" @onkeydown="OnKeyDown">
        <div class="dialog-backdrop" @onclick="RequestCloseAsync"></div>

        <div class="dialog-panel @SizeClass" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="@Title">
            <header class="dialog-head">
                <div class="dialog-head-text">
                    <span class="dialog-icon">
                        <Icon Name="@IconName" Size="19" />
                    </span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>@Title</h3>
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Subtitle))
                        {
                            <p>@Subtitle</p>
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="dialog-close" title="إغلاق" @onclick="RequestCloseAsync">
                    <Icon Name="x" Size="18" />
                </button>
            </header>

            <div class="dialog-body">
                @ChildContent
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public bool IsOpen { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback OnClose { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string Title { get; set; } = "";
    [Parameter] public string Subtitle { get; set; } = "";
    [Parameter] public string IconName { get; set; } = "plus";
    [Parameter] public string Size { get; set; } = "md";
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }

    private bool render;
    private bool closing;
    private bool shouldFocus;
    private ElementReference layerRef;

    private string SizeClass => $"dialog-{Size}";

    protected override async Task OnParametersSetAsync()
    {
        if (IsOpen && !render)
        {
            render = true;
            closing = false;
            shouldFocus = true;
        }
        else if (!IsOpen && render && !closing)
        {
            // حركة خروج قصيرة قبل ما ينشال العنصر من الشجرة
            closing = true;
            StateHasChanged();
            await Task.Delay(170);
            render = false;
            closing = false;
        }
    }

    protected override async Task OnAfterRenderAsync(bool firstRender)
    {
        if (shouldFocus && render)
        {
            shouldFocus = false;
            // التركيز على الطبقة حتى يشتغل زر Escape
            await layerRef.FocusAsync();
        }
    }

    private async Task RequestCloseAsync()
    {
        if (closing)
            return;

        await OnClose.InvokeAsync();
    }

    private async Task OnKeyDown(KeyboardEventArgs args)
    {
        if (args.Key == "Escape")
            await RequestCloseAsync();
    }
}
